# Performance Rules

## Allowed

- Server Components for data fetching
- Module-scope DB Pool
- Select only required columns
- Database indexes on FKs and filter columns
- `next/image` for images
- Lazy loading heavy client components
- Marketing ISR (`revalidate = 120`) + `src/server/cache/public-catalog.ts` `unstable_cache` loaders
- Page facades (`getHomePageData` / `getBookingPageData`) for route composition
- Homepage `HomeSearchProvider` (search-only) instead of full booking flow on the hero
- Booking `force-dynamic` for searchParams while still using cached catalog loaders
- Lazy `next/dynamic` for heavy booking/search UI; client-only `flag-icons` CSS in `FlagIcon`

## Forbidden

- Unnecessary `"use client"` boundaries
- N+1 queries
- New DB connection per request
- Client-side fetching for SSR-able data
- Giant client state trees
- Unnecessary Context providers
- Unbounded queries without pagination

## Before optimizing

Read `/docs/PERFORMANCE.md`.
